``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .group_by('Manager', 'Status', 'Product')
 .agg(Quantity=pl.len(),
      Price=pl.sum('Price'))
 .pivot(index=['Manager','Status'], on='Product',
        values=['Quantity','Price'], sort_columns=True)
 .sort('Manager','Status')
 .fill_null(0)
)
```

